      "message": "You could probably simplify this further by using a SparseArray\u003cSparseIntArray\u003e permissionToAppIds;\n\nThis would allow to do stuff like:\n\n```\nif (isValidPermission(permission)) {\n    SparseIntArray permissions \u003d permissionToAppIds.get(permission);\n    // If null make a new one and add to the map\n    permissions.add(appId);\n} else {\n    Log.e(TAG, \"unknown permission...\");\n}\n// Update netd with all the sparseIntArrays\n```\n\nSo \"isValidPermission\" can be reused in the loop for T+ below, and you don\u0027t need to have a loop for it in PermissionMonitor",
